<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:03.929" end="00:00:05.949" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.300" end="00:00:18.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 12 nannies in 1 year and I&#39;m number 12.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.030" end="00:00:20.600" style="s2">[music] Take a good look at me</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.000" end="00:00:23.600" style="s2">everybody. Good luck maid.</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.600" end="00:00:26.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia Lawson, day maid starts today.</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.600" end="00:00:29.000" style="s2">Floors, glass and the East Wing. You&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.100" end="00:00:29.000" style="s2">be told the rest.</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.200" end="00:00:35.700" style="s2">Number 12 walked.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.900" end="00:00:38.600" style="s2">Yes, this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.700" end="00:00:38.600" style="s2">Book the girl&#39;s seat.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.955" end="00:00:41.975" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.540" end="00:00:46.560" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.300" end="00:00:58.300" style="s2">Put that down. Maids don&#39;t touch my</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.000" end="00:01:01.000" style="s2">niece and they don&#39;t touch her things.</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.300" end="00:01:02.600" style="s2">You clean the floor she walks on.</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.000" end="00:01:05.000" style="s2">You don&#39;t look at her and you don&#39;t talk</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.600" end="00:01:05.000" style="s2">to her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.395" end="00:01:13.900" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.200" end="00:01:15.400" style="s2">Rosie.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.900" end="00:01:17.700" style="s2">Upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.400" end="00:01:17.700" style="s2">Now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.875" end="00:01:23.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.600" end="00:01:35.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on. You do braids on Camberton</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.400" end="00:01:37.000" style="s2">Road. I&#39;ve seen you in the window of</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.200" end="00:01:38.700" style="s2">that pink shop.</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.000" end="00:01:40.400" style="s2">Saturdays and evenings. I&#39;m sorry about</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.700" end="00:01:42.400" style="s2">your job.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.400" end="00:01:44.300" style="s2">Don&#39;t be sorry, honey.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.400" end="00:01:46.300" style="s2">That little girl never did one thing to</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.300" end="00:01:47.500" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.300" end="00:01:49.600" style="s2">Listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.500" end="00:01:50.800" style="s2">When she offers you money to leave, take</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.600" end="00:01:53.600" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.800" end="00:01:53.600" style="s2">Everybody does.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.592" end="00:02:24.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Number 12 walked out this morning,</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.192" end="00:02:25.992" style="s2">little brother.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.492" end="00:02:29.292" style="s2">The program in Switzerland holds her</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.992" end="00:02:29.292" style="s2">seat until the 23rd.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.492" end="00:02:34.892" style="s2">The doctor is ready and the papers are</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.292" end="00:02:34.892" style="s2">ready. Come home and sign.</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.891" end="00:02:37.911" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.292" end="00:02:44.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My sister thinks my daughter is broken</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.392" end="00:02:46.292" style="s2">and not one word out of her.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.792" end="00:02:48.336" style="s2">She used to talk my ear off at</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.292" end="00:02:50.092" style="s2">breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.336" end="00:02:52.192" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.092" end="00:02:55.492" style="s2">Now she points.</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.192" end="00:02:58.092" style="s2">Number 12 gone at day six. I had her at</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.492" end="00:03:01.392" style="s2">day nine.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.092" end="00:03:04.392" style="s2">That&#39;s $40 I&#39;m never seeing again, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.392" end="00:03:05.692" style="s2">You&#39;ve been betting on my nannies?</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.392" end="00:03:07.292" style="s2">Somebody in that house has to keep</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.692" end="00:03:10.192" style="s2">score, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.292" end="00:03:10.192" style="s2">Nobody else is.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.592" end="00:03:17.692" style="s2">Finish the quarterly review without me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.092" end="00:03:20.192" style="s2">Send me whatever you decide and I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.692" end="00:03:20.192" style="s2">sign it tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.892" end="00:03:26.792" style="s2">Home early [music] in the middle of a</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.292" end="00:03:29.392" style="s2">Monday?</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.792" end="00:03:29.392" style="s2">That&#39;s new, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.692" end="00:03:37.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And that squirrel looked left and he</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.492" end="00:03:40.892" style="s2">looked right and he climbed straight in</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.492" end="00:03:40.892" style="s2">through the window of the police car.</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.992" end="00:03:47.792" style="s2">Watch the three strands. Over. One</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.492" end="00:03:50.992" style="s2">strand breaks, Rosie.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.792" end="00:03:50.992" style="s2">Three strands hold.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.992" end="00:03:56.692" style="s2">Is that somebody I know?</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.992" end="00:03:58.692" style="s2">I&#39;ll put her right at the end so she</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.692" end="00:03:59.592" style="s2">clicks when she walks.</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.692" end="00:04:01.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.592" end="00:04:03.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the squirrel grabs the biggest donut</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.894" end="00:04:06.894" style="s2">in the box.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.794" end="00:04:08.494" style="s2">Chocolate with sprinkles.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.894" end="00:04:10.794" style="s2">But the donut is bigger than the</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.494" end="00:04:13.394" style="s2">squirrel and now he can&#39;t get out of the</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.794" end="00:04:13.394" style="s2">window.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.794" end="00:04:19.094" style="s2">The officer comes back with his coffee</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.394" end="00:04:22.094" style="s2">and there&#39;s a squirrel in his seat</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.094" end="00:04:23.694" style="s2">wearing a donut like a tire.</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.094" end="00:04:26.294" style="s2">And the officer just looks at him and</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.694" end="00:04:27.898" style="s2">says, Sir, I&#39;m going to need you to step</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.294" end="00:04:29.918" style="s2">out of the vehicle.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.898" end="00:04:29.918" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.294" end="00:04:38.294" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. I know I&#39;m not supposed to</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.994" end="00:04:41.294" style="s2">touch her. She was sitting on the stairs</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.294" end="00:04:42.894" style="s2">with her hair all undone and I thought</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.294" end="00:04:44.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t stop.</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.894" end="00:04:48.094" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.894" end="00:04:49.694" style="s2">Finish her hair however long it takes.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.094" end="00:04:52.694" style="s2">That&#39;s the first sound she&#39;s made since</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.694" end="00:04:52.694" style="s2">we buried Simone.</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.094" end="00:04:56.994" style="s2">13 months.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.194" end="00:05:07.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who did that to her head?</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.794" end="00:05:12.694" style="s2">I did, ma&#39;am. Cornrows and her name and</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.494" end="00:05:16.694" style="s2">beads at the ends.</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.694" end="00:05:16.694" style="s2">The maid. Of course it was the maid.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.094" end="00:05:25.294" style="s2">Little brother, we have a doctor and a</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.194" end="00:05:27.394" style="s2">plan,</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.294" end="00:05:30.694" style="s2">a program in Switzerland, the best in</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.394" end="00:05:32.894" style="s2">Europe, and a seat on the 23rd.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.694" end="00:05:36.094" style="s2">A girl with a bag of beads doesn&#39;t undo</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.894" end="00:05:36.094" style="s2">a year of silence.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.694" end="00:05:42.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She laughed. I stood in that doorway</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.293" end="00:05:43.894" style="s2">[music] and I heard my daughter laugh.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.094" end="00:05:46.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You weren&#39;t there.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.894" end="00:05:49.694" style="s2">Children laugh at cartoons.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.694" end="00:05:51.694" style="s2">They laugh at dogs on television.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.694" end="00:05:53.094" style="s2">Since when does my brother take advice</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.694" end="00:05:54.694" style="s2">from the hair girl?</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.094" end="00:05:58.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll do her hair</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.694" end="00:05:58.094" style="s2">every day starting tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.694" end="00:06:03.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then she does it on a maid&#39;s pay.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.894" end="00:06:06.795" style="s2">20 minutes, hair only, and then she goes</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.294" end="00:06:10.295" style="s2">back to floors. Is that clear?</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.795" end="00:06:12.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma&#39;am. 20 minutes. I work fast.</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.295" end="00:06:14.664" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enjoy your little laugh, Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.195" end="00:06:16.684" style="s2">Switzerland is still on the 23rd.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.664" end="00:06:16.684" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.795" end="00:06:28.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get the car</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.995" end="00:06:28.095" style="s2">and don&#39;t let her see us.</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.595" end="00:06:33.795" style="s2">Your brother walked out of his own</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.895" end="00:06:35.495" style="s2">quarterly review today, CC, in the</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.795" end="00:06:38.295" style="s2">middle of a Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.495" end="00:06:40.795" style="s2">That makes him a problem.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.295" end="00:06:43.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; brother is a widower who can&#39;t open his</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.795" end="00:06:46.895" style="s2">own mail.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.295" end="00:06:49.595" style="s2">I hand him a pen and he signs.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.895" end="00:06:51.695" style="s2">12 nannies, 12 checks.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.595" end="00:06:53.395" style="s2">Every one of them quit and wrote that</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.695" end="00:06:55.895" style="s2">she feared for her safety with that</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.395" end="00:06:55.895" style="s2">child.</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.395" end="00:06:59.995" style="s2">And the doctor puts all 12 letters in</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.295" end="00:07:02.495" style="s2">his report.</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.995" end="00:07:02.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And then?</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.895" end="00:07:11.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On the 22nd at Simone&#39;s Foundation Gala,</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.295" end="00:07:15.095" style="s2">my brother names me sole trustee of the</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.195" end="00:07:19.395" style="s2">Girls Trust in front of the whole city.</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.095" end="00:07:19.395" style="s2">On the 23rd, the girl flies to Zurich.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.495" end="00:07:30.095" style="s2">On the 24th, I vote Simone&#39;s 30% of the</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.095" end="00:07:30.095" style="s2">company your way.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.095" end="00:07:39.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your 60 million is due on the 31st, not</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.195" end="00:07:41.595" style="s2">a day later.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.795" end="00:07:43.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My board doesn&#39;t care how charming your</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.595" end="00:07:45.995" style="s2">plans sound.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.995" end="00:07:48.795" style="s2">A maid made her giggle today. That&#39;s all</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.995" end="00:07:51.695" style="s2">it was. I&#39;ll take care of the maid.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.795" end="00:07:51.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See that you do.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.095" end="00:08:02.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Laughing</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.895" end="00:08:02.895" style="s2">in my house.</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.297" end="00:08:20.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s her second bus, Dex.</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.497" end="00:08:23.597" style="s2">She does this every day. Two buses here</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.697" end="00:08:26.297" style="s2">and two buses home.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.597" end="00:08:29.397" style="s2">Some of us grew up on those buses, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.297" end="00:08:29.397" style="s2">You get a lot of thinking done.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.697" end="00:08:48.591" style="s2">Pay or vacate by the 31st.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.997" end="00:08:50.611" style="s2">Merry Christmas from the landlord.</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.591" end="00:08:50.611" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.297" end="00:09:00.897" style="s2">Boss, you&#39;re about to walk into a salon</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.297" end="00:09:04.097" style="s2">full of women in a $2,000 suit.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.897" end="00:09:04.097" style="s2">Yes, I know.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.697" end="00:09:07.197" style="s2">Amen.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.206" end="00:09:14.191" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.171" end="00:09:14.191" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.497" end="00:09:24.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know that face from the newspaper.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.997" end="00:09:26.197" style="s2">You&#39;re Simone&#39;s husband. I&#39;m Pearl. This</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.397" end="00:09:27.997" style="s2">is my shop, and you&#39;re blocking my</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.197" end="00:09:30.697" style="s2">light.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.997" end="00:09:30.697" style="s2">Sit down, baby.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.497" end="00:09:36.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Pearl, that man&#39;s suit costs more</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.497" end="00:09:38.426" style="s2">THAN MY CAR.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.406" end="00:09:38.426" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.497" end="00:09:47.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOUR WIFE SAT IN CHAIR THREE EVERY OTHER</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.297" end="00:09:49.697" style="s2">Saturday for eight years. My</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.297" end="00:09:51.997" style="s2">granddaughter did her hair.</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.697" end="00:09:54.197" style="s2">And your baby&#39;s hair since she was two</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.997" end="00:09:56.997" style="s2">years old.</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.197" end="00:09:58.697" style="s2">Right there on her mama&#39;s lap.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.997" end="00:10:00.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every other Saturday, she told me she</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.697" end="00:10:03.397" style="s2">had errands.</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.497" end="00:10:05.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And she told us you were at the office.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.397" end="00:10:07.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were, mostly.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.897" end="00:10:09.597" style="s2">Rosie hasn&#39;t let anybody near her in in</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.997" end="00:10:12.098" style="s2">year.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.597" end="00:10:13.698" style="s2">12 women tried.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.098" end="00:10:15.698" style="s2">Why you?</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.698" end="00:10:17.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rosie knows my hand, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.698" end="00:10:20.798" style="s2">That&#39;s all it is. No magic. Same</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.998" end="00:10:22.898" style="s2">squirrel stories, same three strands.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.798" end="00:10:24.198" style="s2">Just in your house now.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.898" end="00:10:26.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why didn&#39;t you tell me who you</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.198" end="00:10:26.498" style="s2">were?</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.898" end="00:10:31.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We brought a wreath to the funeral.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.298" end="00:10:34.498" style="s2">White roses</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.898" end="00:10:36.898" style="s2">with a card from chair three.</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.498" end="00:10:38.298" style="s2">Your sister had it put out on the curb,</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.898" end="00:10:40.598" style="s2">and she had us stopped at the church</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.298" end="00:10:40.598" style="s2">door.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.398" end="00:10:44.798" style="s2">If she knew who I was, I&#39;d be gone by</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.298" end="00:10:47.198" style="s2">lunch, and Rosie would have nobody</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.798" end="00:10:47.198" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.498" end="00:10:58.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $18,000 by the 31st or 31 years of this</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.898" end="00:11:01.198" style="s2">shop going in a dumpster.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.198" end="00:11:04.598" style="s2">That&#39;s why my grandbaby rides two buses</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.198" end="00:11:04.598" style="s2">and works two jobs.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.498" end="00:11:11.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She won&#39;t hear a word of this from me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.798" end="00:11:13.198" style="s2">Not my sister,</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.098" end="00:11:15.798" style="s2">not anybody in that house.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.198" end="00:11:15.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.198" end="00:11:20.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One strand breaks.</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.898" end="00:11:23.172" style="s2">Three strands hold. She told your baby</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.898" end="00:11:23.698" style="s2">that one, didn&#39;t she? It&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.172" end="00:11:27.498" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.698" end="00:11:27.498" style="s2">She steals [applause] all my best lines.</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.598" end="00:11:34.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morning. We didn&#39;t meet properly last</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.498" end="00:11:34.798" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.398" end="00:11:40.298" style="s2">I&#39;m Dex.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.798" end="00:11:42.798" style="s2">I drove his wife for 10 [music] years.</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.298" end="00:11:44.598" style="s2">I drive him now.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.798" end="00:11:45.698" style="s2">And I&#39;ve driven 12 nannies to the bus</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.598" end="00:11:49.398" style="s2">stop.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.698" end="00:11:49.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you bet on every one of them.</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.993" end="00:11:54.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.598" end="00:11:58.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A man needs a hobby.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.698" end="00:11:59.898" style="s2">Number three lasted two days and cried</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.598" end="00:12:02.398" style="s2">in my backseat all the way to the</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.898" end="00:12:02.398" style="s2">airport.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.098" end="00:12:10.498" style="s2">How many days do I put you down for?</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.898" end="00:12:12.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put me down for forever.</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.498" end="00:12:14.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody bets forever in this house, Ms.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.299" end="00:12:16.283" style="s2">Lawson.</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.263" end="00:12:16.283" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.499" end="00:12:23.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maid, 20 minutes a child, hair only.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.599" end="00:12:25.799" style="s2">She signed it in gold.</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.799" end="00:12:27.799" style="s2">Ms. Callaway times that clock herself,</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.799" end="00:12:30.299" style="s2">baby, 19.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.799" end="00:12:33.499" style="s2">20 minutes, hair only, no talking. She</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.299" end="00:12:33.499" style="s2">didn&#39;t say anything about humming.</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.083" end="00:12:45.103" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.899" end="00:13:01.199" style="s2">You wrestle that pillow all night, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.599" end="00:13:03.999" style="s2">you? This one row tells on you every</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.199" end="00:13:03.999" style="s2">single morning.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.899" end="00:13:09.199" style="s2">Rosie, sweetheart, this is Dr. Hollis.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.699" end="00:13:11.099" style="s2">He&#39;s the doctor writing your report for</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.199" end="00:13:14.099" style="s2">Switzerland, and he has 10 minutes for</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.099" end="00:13:14.099" style="s2">his final notes.</p>
