<p begin="00:13:15.299" end="00:13:19.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rosie, can you tell me your name?</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.729" end="00:13:23.749" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.299" end="00:13:28.899" style="s2">Withdrawn,</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.599" end="00:13:31.799" style="s2">hostile to caregivers, consistent with</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.899" end="00:13:31.799" style="s2">the staff letters.</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.599" end="00:13:38.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, she&#39;s 6 years old, and a man she</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.999" end="00:13:40.299" style="s2">doesn&#39;t know is standing over her with a</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.499" end="00:13:43.099" style="s2">clipboard.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.299" end="00:13:45.964" style="s2">And the caregiver she&#39;s so hostile to is</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.099" end="00:13:47.984" style="s2">the one she&#39;s hiding behind.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.964" end="00:13:47.984" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.999" end="00:13:52.514" style="s2">Did anyone ask the hair girl</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.099" end="00:13:53.699" style="s2">you&#39;re here to braid</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.514" end="00:13:56.299" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.699" end="00:13:58.299" style="s2">at 9:20?</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.299" end="00:14:00.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 minutes, Ms. Callaway.</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.299" end="00:14:03.999" style="s2">I have what I need. Those letters told</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.499" end="00:14:03.999" style="s2">me most of it before I walked in.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.199" end="00:14:08.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll see you at the gala, Doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.399" end="00:14:10.899" style="s2">Finish the braid, maid, and get back to</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.199" end="00:14:10.899" style="s2">the floors.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.509" end="00:14:13.529" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.499" end="00:14:22.301" style="s2">Nobody&#39;s writing anything about you in</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.301" end="00:14:22.301" style="s2">here, not while I&#39;m in this room.</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.644" end="00:14:24.664" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.801" end="00:14:46.801" style="s2">Ladies, come in, come in. The whole</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.501" end="00:14:48.901" style="s2">committee in my foyer before 10:00,</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.801" end="00:14:51.901" style="s2">Simone would be thrilled.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.901" end="00:14:55.501" style="s2">Cece, this marble, I forget every single</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.901" end="00:14:55.501" style="s2">time how much of it you have.</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.901" end="00:15:03.501" style="s2">Oh no.</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.601" end="00:15:03.501" style="s2">Nia dear.</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.401" end="00:15:08.801" style="s2">Not the mop. On your knees, please. It</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.901" end="00:15:12.301" style="s2">gets into the veins of the stone and a</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.801" end="00:15:12.301" style="s2">mop just pushes it around.</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.101" end="00:15:29.455" style="s2">This is our new hair girl. She braids,</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.701" end="00:15:31.475" style="s2">she scrubs, very versatile.</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.455" end="00:15:31.475" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.901" end="00:15:37.901" style="s2">Hold still, dear. My sister keeps</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.301" end="00:15:39.601" style="s2">telling me good help is gone.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.901" end="00:15:41.201" style="s2">I&#39;m sending her proof.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.601" end="00:15:45.301" style="s2">Does she do hair for the staff too,</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.201" end="00:15:45.301" style="s2">Cece, or only for the floors?</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.901" end="00:15:49.101" style="s2">She did my nieces this week, if you can</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.795" end="00:15:51.101" style="s2">[music] believe it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.101" end="00:15:54.101" style="s2">20 minutes upstairs and then right back</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.101" end="00:15:57.101" style="s2">down here where she&#39;s useful.</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.101" end="00:16:00.701" style="s2">Get the edges too, Nia. Coffee travels.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.101" end="00:16:00.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma&#39;am. I&#39;ve got the edges.</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.896" end="00:16:02.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.301" end="00:16:07.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ladies, the sun room. We have a gala to</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.401" end="00:16:08.101" style="s2">plan and my brother has a pin to pick</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.301" end="00:16:10.121" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.101" end="00:16:10.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.751" end="00:16:31.302" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.102" end="00:16:31.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that somebody I know?</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.202" end="00:16:41.002" style="s2">6,200. That&#39;s all of it, grandma. Both</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.202" end="00:16:43.202" style="s2">jobs and every tip since August.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.002" end="00:16:44.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;re 11,800</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.202" end="00:16:47.802" style="s2">short.</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.402" end="00:16:50.402" style="s2">And the 31st is 3 weeks off.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.802" end="00:16:54.402" style="s2">I&#39;ve been short before, baby. I&#39;ve never</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.402" end="00:16:54.402" style="s2">been short with a red paper on my door.</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.402" end="00:17:03.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She dropped this to me off the landing</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.002" end="00:17:03.602" style="s2">this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.431" end="00:17:09.302" style="s2">[music] That baby went quiet the day</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.202" end="00:17:09.302" style="s2">they buried her mama.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.502" end="00:17:14.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you do.</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.602" end="00:17:16.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My own mama left me in your chair when I</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.602" end="00:17:19.202" style="s2">was six</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.302" end="00:17:22.502" style="s2">and never came back.</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.202" end="00:17:24.702" style="s2">I didn&#39;t say one word all summer.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.502" end="00:17:26.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I didn&#39;t make you. I didn&#39;t ask you</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.702" end="00:17:30.302" style="s2">one</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.502" end="00:17:33.102" style="s2">I didn&#39;t ask you one single question.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.302" end="00:17:34.702" style="s2">I just did your hair every Sunday on the</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.102" end="00:17:36.502" style="s2">back porch</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.702" end="00:17:38.702" style="s2">till one morning you asked me for the</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.502" end="00:17:41.102" style="s2">purple beads.</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.702" end="00:17:42.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s all I&#39;m doing up there.</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.102" end="00:17:44.502" style="s2">Her hair.</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.202" end="00:17:46.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And no questions.</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.502" end="00:17:50.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And her aunt has a doctor with a</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.102" end="00:17:50.302" style="s2">clipboard who wants her on a plane.</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.302" end="00:17:57.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A quiet child doesn&#39;t trust the one who</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.302" end="00:17:59.802" style="s2">asks.</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.002" end="00:18:03.002" style="s2">She trusts the one who waits.</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.802" end="00:18:05.302" style="s2">So quit waiting in that big cold house.</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.002" end="00:18:07.802" style="s2">Bring that baby here on Saturday to her</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.302" end="00:18:09.802" style="s2">mama&#39;s chair.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.802" end="00:18:11.902" style="s2">And bring her daddy. He sits in the</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.802" end="00:18:14.802" style="s2">waiting chair like every other daddy on</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.902" end="00:18:14.802" style="s2">Campbellton Road.</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.102" end="00:18:20.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, he&#39;s a billionaire.</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.102" end="00:18:23.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then he</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.503" end="00:18:23.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; can afford the bus.</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.687" end="00:18:25.707" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.617" end="00:18:29.637" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.703" end="00:18:35.903" style="s2">Thank you all for coming to Simone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.503" end="00:18:38.703" style="s2">luncheon. She loved this room.</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.903" end="00:18:40.703" style="s2">On the 22nd at her winter gala,</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.703" end="00:18:44.403" style="s2">my brother signs the papers that make me</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.703" end="00:18:47.203" style="s2">trustee of my niece&#39;s future.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.403" end="00:18:50.603" style="s2">And on the 23rd, our Rosie flies to the</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.203" end="00:18:52.507" style="s2">finest children&#39;s program in Europe.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.603" end="00:18:54.473" style="s2">That&#39;s what Simone would have wanted.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.507" end="00:18:56.493" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.473" end="00:18:56.493" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.903" end="00:19:01.003" style="s2">And look who&#39;s serving us today. Ladies,</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.403" end="00:19:03.403" style="s2">this is the maid who thinks a bag of</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.003" end="00:19:05.003" style="s2">beads is therapy.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.403" end="00:19:06.803" style="s2">In the evening, she moonlights in a</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.003" end="00:19:08.303" style="s2">strip mall hair shop on Campbellton</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.803" end="00:19:10.303" style="s2">Road.</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.303" end="00:19:12.158" style="s2">That&#39;s the one from my photo on her</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.303" end="00:19:13.003" style="s2">knees with a rag.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.158" end="00:19:14.603" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.003" end="00:19:16.903" style="s2">My brother lets her play with Rosie&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.603" end="00:19:18.203" style="s2">hair 20 minutes a day.</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.903" end="00:19:21.003" style="s2">I let him keep his little hobby until</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.203" end="00:19:21.003" style="s2">the 23rd.</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.603" end="00:19:27.603" style="s2">Do one of us next, Cece. I&#39;ll hold my</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.003" end="00:19:27.603" style="s2">glass out.</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.003" end="00:19:42.403" style="s2">Let&#39;s see if it washes out.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.303" end="00:19:57.703" style="s2">Smile for them, Nia. You&#39;ll be famous on</p>
