<p begin="00:20:01.283" end="00:20:04.303" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.303" end="00:20:06.303" style="s2">Ethan, it&#39;s just a joke. The girls were</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.303" end="00:20:09.403" style="s2">having a little fun. And [music] look,</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.303" end="00:20:12.603" style="s2">she didn&#39;t even drop a glass.</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.403" end="00:20:12.603" style="s2">You should give her a raise.</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.103" end="00:20:25.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.379" end="00:20:35.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.705" end="00:20:46.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.905" end="00:20:48.444" style="s2">I should have been in that room from the</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.105" end="00:20:50.464" style="s2">first word, not the last.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.444" end="00:20:50.464" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.505" end="00:20:53.905" style="s2">I was on a call about freight</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.405" end="00:20:56.805" style="s2">while my sister poured a bottle over you</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.905" end="00:20:56.805" style="s2">in Simone&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.505" end="00:21:03.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s champagne, sir. [music] It comes</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.605" end="00:21:03.905" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.094" end="00:21:10.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.105" end="00:21:11.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the red paper on your</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.205" end="00:21:13.605" style="s2">grandmother&#39;s door.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.905" end="00:21:16.005" style="s2">Take it and let me do one thing right</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.605" end="00:21:16.005" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.205" end="00:21:20.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it isn&#39;t Grandma&#39;s shop anymore,</p>
