<p begin="00:32:16.912" end="00:32:20.012" style="s2">Only if she wants to pick up the radio,</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.512" end="00:32:23.412" style="s2">sir. My grandma would hang that braid on</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.012" end="00:32:23.412" style="s2">the wall by the door as a warning.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.812" end="00:32:28.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I run 11,000 people. I&#39;ve closed deals</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.112" end="00:32:31.212" style="s2">in four languages.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.912" end="00:32:34.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you can&#39;t run three strands of hair.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.212" end="00:32:34.012" style="s2">Give me your hands.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.127" end="00:32:41.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.713" end="00:32:46.987" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One strand breaks.</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.913" end="00:32:49.913" style="s2">Three strands hold.</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.987" end="00:32:52.313" style="s2">[music] You, her, and her mama in the</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.913" end="00:32:52.313" style="s2">middle.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.413" end="00:32:59.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Simone tried to teach me once on a</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.513" end="00:33:02.913" style="s2">Sunday right here in this room.</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.813" end="00:33:02.913" style="s2">I told her I had a call.</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.513" end="00:33:17.013" style="s2">Sit down, Nia, please. You&#39;ve been on</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.613" end="00:33:17.013" style="s2">your feet since 6:00 this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.013" end="00:33:28.013" style="s2">Cece handed me a list,</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.313" end="00:33:30.713" style="s2">and I hired every name on it without</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.013" end="00:33:30.713" style="s2">meeting one of them.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.913" end="00:33:35.813" style="s2">Then I went back to the office.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.013" end="00:33:38.413" style="s2">I signed whatever she put on my desk.</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.813" end="00:33:40.613" style="s2">School forms, doctors, papers for a</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.413" end="00:33:41.813" style="s2">trust I&#39;ve never read.</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.613" end="00:33:45.713" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t walk through that front door</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.813" end="00:33:45.713" style="s2">without seeing Simone on the stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.413" end="00:33:53.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re walking through it now, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.513" end="00:33:55.013" style="s2">You were on your knees in the sunroom</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.013" end="00:33:58.313" style="s2">this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.013" end="00:33:58.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With a braid like a horn.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.713" end="00:34:03.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She wore it all through breakfast, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.713" end="00:34:03.813" style="s2">She wouldn&#39;t let me touch it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.933" end="00:34:06.953" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.483" end="00:34:15.013" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.813" end="00:34:18.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His office sent it over today.</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.013" end="00:34:20.413" style="s2">He signs it on Friday.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.113" end="00:34:22.213" style="s2">He says she gets worse in this house.</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.413" end="00:34:24.813" style="s2">He says Switzerland or she may never</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.213" end="00:34:24.813" style="s2">speak again.</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.713" end="00:34:33.413" style="s2">On Wednesday, I&#39;m supposed to stand up</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.313" end="00:34:37.113" style="s2">at Simone&#39;s gala</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.413" end="00:34:37.113" style="s2">and sign whatever comes after this.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.413" end="00:34:41.413" style="s2">You&#39;re the only person my daughter</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.713" end="00:34:41.413" style="s2">trusts.</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.713" end="00:34:44.714" style="s2">Tell me I&#39;m missing.</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.214" end="00:35:04.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nanny one, last winter.</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.714" end="00:35:06.504" style="s2">I can no longer stay in a home where I</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.614" end="00:35:08.524" style="s2">fear for my safety.</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.504" end="00:35:08.524" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.214" end="00:35:16.414" style="s2">Nanny four, I can no longer stay in a</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.214" end="00:35:16.414" style="s2">home where I fear for my safety.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.714" end="00:35:19.914" style="s2">Nanny nine, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.214" end="00:35:23.914" style="s2">the same words.</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.914" end="00:35:27.214" style="s2">Nanny 12, 10 days ago.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.914" end="00:35:27.214" style="s2">The same words again.</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.414" end="00:35:34.814" style="s2">12 times, sir. And look where the comma</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.614" end="00:35:37.614" style="s2">sits.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.814" end="00:35:39.714" style="s2">Right after home.</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.614" end="00:35:41.014" style="s2">That comma doesn&#39;t belong there.</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.714" end="00:35:43.714" style="s2">My grandmother would cut it out with a</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.014" end="00:35:43.714" style="s2">red pen.</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.414" end="00:35:51.914" style="s2">12 women don&#39;t make the same mistake in</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.414" end="00:35:53.914" style="s2">the same place.</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.914" end="00:35:56.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 12 different women don&#39;t write one</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.914" end="00:35:56.514" style="s2">sentence.</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.514" end="00:36:01.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unless one woman wrote it for all of</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.214" end="00:36:01.514" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.214" end="00:36:09.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.314" end="00:36:11.414" style="s2">Not Cece.</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.614" end="00:36:15.314" style="s2">She sat with me the whole night Simone</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.414" end="00:36:15.314" style="s2">died in that hospital hallway.</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.614" end="00:36:23.514" style="s2">She moved in here the next week</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.214" end="00:36:23.514" style="s2">to hold this house together.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.114" end="00:36:30.214" style="s2">You don&#39;t know her.</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.614" end="00:36:30.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, sir. I don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.014" end="00:36:34.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So let me ask somebody who does.</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.714" end="00:36:39.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Number 12 gets her hair done on</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.114" end="00:36:41.114" style="s2">Campbellton Road.</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.614" end="00:36:42.414" style="s2">I carried her suitcase down your front</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.114" end="00:36:45.516" style="s2">steps.</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.414" end="00:36:47.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if Cece hears that you asked.</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.516" end="00:36:49.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we have a comma and she has a</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.416" end="00:36:52.116" style="s2">doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.216" end="00:36:55.516" style="s2">Not one word to her, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.116" end="00:36:55.516" style="s2">Not till we have more than a comma.</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.645" end="00:37:12.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.816" end="00:37:15.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I moved your appointment up a whole</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.416" end="00:37:16.195" style="s2">week, Keisha, so my grandbaby could have</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.216" end="00:37:17.116" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.195" end="00:37:19.116" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.116" end="00:37:20.716" style="s2">Don&#39;t go saying I never did nothing for</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.116" end="00:37:23.216" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.716" end="00:37:25.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Pearl, you gave me a hard chair and</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.216" end="00:37:27.616" style="s2">a long wait.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.116" end="00:37:28.716" style="s2">I&#39;m grateful for both.</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.616" end="00:37:31.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keisha,</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.716" end="00:37:33.016" style="s2">did that baby ever hurt you?</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.516" end="00:37:36.116" style="s2">Even once</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.016" end="00:37:36.116" style="s2">in all those days?</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.716" end="00:37:42.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That baby never hit her life.</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.816" end="00:37:45.316" style="s2">She sat at the window every afternoon</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.616" end="00:37:46.716" style="s2">and waited for a car that wasn&#39;t coming.</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.316" end="00:37:49.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did [music] you write that you</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.716" end="00:37:49.916" style="s2">feared for your safety?</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.016" end="00:37:58.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because Miss Callaway wrote it for me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.816" end="00:37:58.516" style="s2">She typed it up and handed me a pen.</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.216" end="00:38:03.216" style="s2">$12,000 to walk out the door and sign my</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.616" end="00:38:06.516" style="s2">name under it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.216" end="00:38:09.616" style="s2">12 nannies, 12 checks, honey.</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.516" end="00:38:09.616" style="s2">I was just the last one.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.906" end="00:38:11.926" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.816" end="00:38:21.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Rosie&#39;s trust.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.016" end="00:38:24.516" style="s2">She paid you out of Rosie&#39;s own money.</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.916" end="00:38:28.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t ask me to say that out loud, Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.516" end="00:38:30.916" style="s2">Not to him, not to anybody.</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.116" end="00:38:33.316" style="s2">She has my signature on a lie.</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.916" end="00:38:34.916" style="s2">She told me she&#39;d sue me for fraud and</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.316" end="00:38:37.616" style="s2">I&#39;d never work in a decent house in this</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.916" end="00:38:37.616" style="s2">city again.</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.916" end="00:38:51.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paid that baby&#39;s own money to make that</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.817" end="00:38:51.717" style="s2">baby look broke. Lord, Lord, Lord.</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.117" end="00:39:07.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Severance.</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.117" end="00:39:10.822" style="s2">My daughter&#39;s money paid a woman to call</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.817" end="00:39:12.842" style="s2">my daughter dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.822" end="00:39:12.842" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.717" end="00:39:17.617" style="s2">I&#39;ll get the trust statements from the</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.817" end="00:39:20.117" style="s2">bank myself, not through the office, not</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.617" end="00:39:21.817" style="s2">through anybody Cece hired.</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.117" end="00:39:25.517" style="s2">If she knows we know,</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.817" end="00:39:25.517" style="s2">she&#39;ll bury every page before Wednesday.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.917" end="00:39:31.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keisha won&#39;t say it out loud, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.017" end="00:39:33.317" style="s2">Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.317" end="00:39:34.717" style="s2">She signed that lie</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.317" end="00:39:38.117" style="s2">and she&#39;s scared to death of what your</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.717" end="00:39:38.117" style="s2">sister can do to her for it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.317" end="00:39:42.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we don&#39;t ask her to.</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.117" end="00:39:45.917" style="s2">We get the paper first</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.817" end="00:39:45.917" style="s2">and the paper talks for her.</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.117" end="00:39:54.017" style="s2">I&#39;ve been asleep for a year, Nia. 13</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.417" end="00:39:56.217" style="s2">months in that house with all the lights</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.017" end="00:39:57.817" style="s2">on and nobody home.</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.217" end="00:40:00.217" style="s2">You walked in with a bag of beads and</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.817" end="00:40:00.217" style="s2">woke it up.</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.222" end="00:40:07.717" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.217" end="00:40:09.717" style="s2">Day 12, just saying. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.717" end="00:40:12.117" style="s2">Nobody&#39;s ever made it to day 12 in that</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.717" end="00:40:12.117" style="s2">house.</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.392" end="00:40:14.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.117" end="00:40:17.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to see that doctor tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.617" end="00:40:21.317" style="s2">He saw her for 10 minutes with a</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.817" end="00:40:21.317" style="s2">clipboard. Let him see her for real.</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.417" end="00:40:26.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s Cece&#39;s doctor, Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.717" end="00:40:30.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s a doctor first.</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.617" end="00:40:30.317" style="s2">Maybe nobody ever asked him to look.</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.817" end="00:40:40.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My assistant tells me you&#39;re employed in</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.817" end="00:40:43.217" style="s2">the Calloway house</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.817" end="00:40:46.217" style="s2">as a maid.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.217" end="00:40:48.017" style="s2">I can give you 5 minutes, Ms. Lawson.</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.217" end="00:40:49.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll be quick, doctor. [music] You</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.017" end="00:40:51.918" style="s2">saw Rosie for 10 minutes with a</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.518" end="00:40:51.918" style="s2">clipboard.</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.518" end="00:40:57.618" style="s2">Come to my grandmother&#39;s shop on</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.818" end="00:41:00.518" style="s2">Campbellton Road this afternoon and</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.618" end="00:41:00.518" style="s2">watch her for an hour.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.318" end="00:41:07.818" style="s2">She laughs.</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.118" end="00:41:09.718" style="s2">She picks her own words in beads.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.818" end="00:41:11.318" style="s2">She spelled her daddy&#39;s name and put it</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.718" end="00:41:14.618" style="s2">in his hand.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.318" end="00:41:14.718" style="s2">She&#39;s not broken, sir. She&#39;s grieving.</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.618" end="00:41:16.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.718" end="00:41:20.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have 12 professional caregivers who</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.418" end="00:41:20.118" style="s2">say otherwise, in writing.</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.918" end="00:41:24.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have 12 letters with one [music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.618" end="00:41:26.518" style="s2">sentence in them.</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.218" end="00:41:28.373" style="s2">The same words and the same comma in the</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.518" end="00:41:29.418" style="s2">same wrong place.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.373" end="00:41:31.018" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.418" end="00:41:33.718" style="s2">Did you ever pick up the phone and call</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.018" end="00:41:33.718" style="s2">one of those women?</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.518" end="00:41:48.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That will be all, Ms. Lawson.</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.918" end="00:41:57.618" style="s2">Your maid just left my office. I&#39;d take</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.218" end="00:41:57.618" style="s2">a closer look at who you hired.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.618" end="00:42:14.818" style="s2">She sat in my office this morning, Ms.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.218" end="00:42:16.818" style="s2">Calloway, in that gray uniform, and she</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.818" end="00:42:19.718" style="s2">knows about the letters.</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.818" end="00:42:21.418" style="s2">12 letters, one sentence, the same</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.718" end="00:42:23.718" style="s2">comma.</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.418" end="00:42:23.718" style="s2">Comma.</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.359" end="00:42:26.818" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.118" end="00:42:29.318" style="s2">She</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.818" end="00:42:31.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And did you, Martin?</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.318" end="00:42:33.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know I didn&#39;t. My name is on that</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.518" end="00:42:35.618" style="s2">report. If anybody starts picking up</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.718" end="00:42:37.818" style="s2">phones</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.618" end="00:42:39.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody picks up a phone.</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.818" end="00:42:42.418" style="s2">I gave up my Sea Island weekend to seat</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.818" end="00:42:44.918" style="s2">this gala, Martin. Martin.</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.418" end="00:42:47.518" style="s2">And I won&#39;t spend it on a maid.</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.918" end="00:42:48.818" style="s2">You signed on Friday the way we agreed,</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.518" end="00:42:51.418" style="s2">and you cash your check the way you</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.818" end="00:42:51.418" style="s2">always do.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.820" end="00:43:02.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emergency con Pearl Lawson.</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.220" end="00:43:04.714" style="s2">Pearl&#39;s Braids, Campbellton Road.</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.694" end="00:43:04.714" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.420" end="00:43:11.020" style="s2">Chair three will miss you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.520" end="00:43:13.620" style="s2">I had your roses put out on the curb</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.020" end="00:43:13.620" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.484" end="00:43:16.505" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.920" end="00:43:20.720" style="s2">Two weeks in my house,</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.920" end="00:43:23.320" style="s2">braiding my niece and reading my brother</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.720" end="00:43:23.320" style="s2">papers.</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.520" end="00:43:35.720" style="s2">It&#39;s Miss Callaway.</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.220" end="00:43:38.920" style="s2">That strip of shops on Campbellton Road,</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.720" end="00:43:38.920" style="s2">the one with the pink sign.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.220" end="00:43:41.520" style="s2">What does the owner want for the</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.320" end="00:43:43.120" style="s2">building?</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.520" end="00:43:46.120" style="s2">No, I didn&#39;t ask what it&#39;s worth. I</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.120" end="00:43:46.120" style="s2">asked what he wants.</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.920" end="00:43:49.320" style="s2">Today,</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.120" end="00:43:51.920" style="s2">cash.</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.320" end="00:43:53.620" style="s2">Put it under CL Holdings, Twyman, and</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.920" end="00:43:55.750" style="s2">have new locks on that door by Monday</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.620" end="00:43:57.720" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.750" end="00:44:00.620" style="s2">[music] Hair girls steal.</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.720" end="00:44:00.620" style="s2">Everyone knows that.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.400" end="00:44:17.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.220" end="00:44:22.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Six of our people in the hospital, sir,</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.320" end="00:44:24.420" style="s2">and two of them in the burn unit. The</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.120" end="00:44:26.320" style="s2">press is already at the gate.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.420" end="00:44:28.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Legal says stay out of it. We put out a</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.320" end="00:44:31.720" style="s2">statement, we send flowers, and we let</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.620" end="00:44:31.720" style="s2">the lawyers drive down.</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.320" end="00:44:38.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Flowers.</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.620" end="00:44:38.020" style="s2">Those are my people in that burn unit.</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.920" end="00:44:42.520" style="s2">Their families are standing at that gate</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.520" end="00:44:45.420" style="s2">right now, and nobody from this company</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.520" end="00:44:45.420" style="s2">is standing with them.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.620" end="00:44:51.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Helicopter&#39;s on the roof in 10 minutes,</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.120" end="00:44:53.021" style="s2">boss.</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.220" end="00:44:55.321" style="s2">I packed you a clean shirt. You won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.021" end="00:44:55.321" style="s2">wear it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.221" end="00:45:03.721" style="s2">Niyah, it&#39;s me. There&#39;s a fire at our</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.521" end="00:45:03.721" style="s2">warehouse in Savannah.</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.621" end="00:45:10.521" style="s2">I have to be with those families</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.921" end="00:45:12.421" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.521" end="00:45:15.121" style="s2">I&#39;ll be back before the gala.</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.421" end="00:45:15.121" style="s2">I swear it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.721" end="00:45:20.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.921" end="00:45:22.921" style="s2">Go and be with them.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.821" end="00:45:24.721" style="s2">I&#39;ve got her.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.921" end="00:45:26.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep her close. Don&#39;t let her out of</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.721" end="00:45:28.106" style="s2">your sight and the bank sends the</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.221" end="00:45:30.126" style="s2">statements tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.106" end="00:45:30.126" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.221" end="00:45:34.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we read them together when you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.521" end="00:45:34.621" style="s2">home, when you&#39;re home.</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.656" end="00:45:36.676" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.321" end="00:45:45.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First time I ever wanted to stay home,</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.921" end="00:45:45.421" style="s2">boss.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.921" end="00:46:04.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Niyah, you&#39;ve done enough for one day.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.721" end="00:46:06.321" style="s2">I&#39;ll give her a bath tonight myself.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.421" end="00:46:09.821" style="s2">Go and help in the kitchen. The cook is</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.321" end="00:46:09.821" style="s2">drowning in gala trays.</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.121" end="00:46:14.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Calloway, I&#39;m halfway down the last</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.421" end="00:46:16.121" style="s2">row.</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.421" end="00:46:18.221" style="s2">If I leave it loose, it frizzes</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.121" end="00:46:19.921" style="s2">overnight and she pulls at it in her</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.221" end="00:46:21.421" style="s2">sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.921" end="00:46:23.121" style="s2">Then it frizzes.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.421" end="00:46:25.721" style="s2">I&#39;m her aunt, sweetheart. I think I can</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.121" end="00:46:27.621" style="s2">manage one bath and one loose braid. Go</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.721" end="00:46:29.221" style="s2">on.</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.621" end="00:46:30.987" style="s2">She likes the squirrel story in the</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.221" end="00:46:33.521" style="s2">bath, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.987" end="00:46:36.821" style="s2">[music] The one with the donut.</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.521" end="00:46:39.921" style="s2">She won&#39;t laugh, but she listens.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.821" end="00:46:39.921" style="s2">I&#39;m sure she does.</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.621" end="00:46:44.221" style="s2">Kitchen, Niyah.</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.621" end="00:46:45.721" style="s2">Niyah.</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.221" end="00:46:46.921" style="s2">I&#39;ll finish you first thing tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.721" end="00:46:50.621" style="s2">baby.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.921" end="00:46:50.621" style="s2">Same row, same bead.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.842" end="00:46:59.862" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.723" end="00:47:13.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There.</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.922" end="00:47:13.723" style="s2">Now you&#39;ve got something of hers, too.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.622" end="00:47:23.223" style="s2">Rosie, come along. Bath time.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.352" end="00:47:29.122" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.223" end="00:47:30.723" style="s2">That&#39;s my good girl.</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.122" end="00:47:33.122" style="s2">Nobody needs you to talk in Switzerland</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.723" end="00:47:33.122" style="s2">either.</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.823" end="00:47:57.122" style="s2">Everyone in line, please. Bags on the</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.122" end="00:47:57.122" style="s2">floor in front of you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.523" end="00:48:03.023" style="s2">Miss Calloway&#39;s orders.</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.323" end="00:48:05.823" style="s2">Simone&#39;s diamond earrings are missing</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.023" end="00:48:05.823" style="s2">from my suite.</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.622" end="00:48:15.422" style="s2">I&#39;ve kept her jewelry safe for my niece</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.523" end="00:48:17.122" style="s2">for 13 months, and tonight her mother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.422" end="00:48:18.823" style="s2">earrings are gone.</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.122" end="00:48:20.723" style="s2">Bags open, please.</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.823" end="00:48:22.323" style="s2">All of you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.723" end="00:48:24.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One at a time, folks. Nobody leaves the</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.323" end="00:48:24.723" style="s2">line.</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.438" end="00:48:37.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.823" end="00:48:43.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whose bag is this?</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.922" end="00:48:46.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mine. It&#39;s mine, but I didn&#39;t I&#39;ve never</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.922" end="00:48:48.823" style="s2">set foot in your suite. Miss Calloway,</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.023" end="00:48:48.823" style="s2">you know I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.922" end="00:48:54.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hair girls steal.</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.122" end="00:48:55.323" style="s2">It&#39;s what they do.</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.023" end="00:48:58.523" style="s2">You&#39;re fired,</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.323" end="00:48:58.523" style="s2">and you&#39;re done in this city.</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.122" end="00:49:03.724" style="s2">There isn&#39;t not in Buckhead that will</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.724" end="00:49:06.524" style="s2">let you through the service gate.</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.724" end="00:49:08.124" style="s2">Call Mr. Calloway. Please. Just call him</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.524" end="00:49:10.824" style="s2">and ask him.</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.124" end="00:49:13.924" style="s2">My brother is standing in a burn unit</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.824" end="00:49:13.924" style="s2">with six families.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.724" end="00:49:21.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, turn around for me. Hands behind</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.724" end="00:49:21.024" style="s2">your back.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.124" end="00:49:29.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the shop on Campbellton Road?</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.734" end="00:49:40.524" style="s2">[music] The locks go on tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.124" end="00:49:40.524" style="s2">31 years and it took me one phone call.</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.424" end="00:49:46.424" style="s2">Rosie.</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.824" end="00:49:48.024" style="s2">Rosie, look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.424" end="00:49:50.924" style="s2">You hear me, baby?</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.024" end="00:49:50.924" style="s2">I&#39;m coming back.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.224" end="00:50:00.924" style="s2">Somebody book her seat for Thursday.</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.449" end="00:50:10.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.124" end="00:50:25.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is Ethan Calloway. Leave a message.</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.224" end="00:50:27.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s me. It&#39;s Naya.</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.324" end="00:50:28.924" style="s2">They&#39;re saying I took Simone&#39;s earrings.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.024" end="00:50:31.824" style="s2">I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.924" end="00:50:35.124" style="s2">I&#39;ve never even been in her suite.</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.824" end="00:50:35.124" style="s2">They found them in my bag.</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.324" end="00:50:39.124" style="s2">And I don&#39;t know how they got there.</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.724" end="00:50:41.324" style="s2">Mr. Calloway,</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.124" end="00:50:42.724" style="s2">Rosie&#39;s alone with her.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.324" end="00:50:45.724" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.724" end="00:50:45.724" style="s2">Please call me back.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.024" end="00:50:52.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like he&#39;s having a long night,</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.124" end="00:50:54.924" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.524" end="00:50:57.424" style="s2">You got somebody who can post your bail?</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.924" end="00:51:00.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My grandmother. She&#39;s 74 and tonight</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.424" end="00:51:03.325" style="s2">somebody is putting a lock on her shop.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.124" end="00:51:03.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I hope she&#39;s got friends.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.325" end="00:51:07.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s got a whole road of them.</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.825" end="00:51:17.325" style="s2">Property for the bench, your coat and</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.625" end="00:51:21.125" style="s2">your bag. The earrings stay with us,</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.325" end="00:51:21.125" style="s2">obviously. Bail hearings at 6:00.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.670" end="00:51:31.690" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.945" end="00:51:38.425" style="s2">[bell]</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.525" end="00:51:38.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; C E C E D I D</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.525" end="00:51:46.725" style="s2">Cece did. You saw her. You saw her put</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.125" end="00:51:49.325" style="s2">them in my bag and you wrote it down for</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.725" end="00:51:49.325" style="s2">me, baby.</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.125" end="00:52:15.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We passed the hat at 4:00 in the</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.425" end="00:52:15.225" style="s2">morning, baby.</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.325" end="00:52:26.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Took us 20 minutes to fill it and took</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.125" end="00:52:26.625" style="s2">that jail 2 hours to count it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.525" end="00:52:36.525" style="s2">31 years, grandma. 31 years on this</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.025" end="00:52:36.525" style="s2">corner and it&#39;s gone because of me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.025" end="00:52:46.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because of her.</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.125" end="00:52:49.325" style="s2">Don&#39;t you put her sin in your pocket.</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.025" end="00:52:49.325" style="s2">It&#39;s heavy enough on her.</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.225" end="00:52:58.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rosie saw her do it. She spelled it out</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.325" end="00:53:01.025" style="s2">for me in her mama&#39;s beads.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.425" end="00:53:01.025" style="s2">Cece did.</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.325" end="00:53:04.927" style="s2">But who&#39;s going to believe the hair girl</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.925" end="00:53:07.727" style="s2">over a Callaway with a six year old</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.927" end="00:53:07.727" style="s2">string of beads.</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.527" end="00:53:17.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody, baby. Not one soul.</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.427" end="00:53:18.727" style="s2">So you don&#39;t bring your word. You bring</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.527" end="00:53:21.127" style="s2">12.</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.727" end="00:53:23.327" style="s2">12 what?</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.127" end="00:53:26.527" style="s2">Every woman in Atlanta sits in</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.327" end="00:53:26.527" style="s2">somebody&#39;s chair.</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.727" end="00:53:32.327" style="s2">12 women quit that house.</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.927" end="00:53:33.327" style="s2">They didn&#39;t stop getting their hair</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.327" end="00:53:36.127" style="s2">done.</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.327" end="00:53:40.527" style="s2">By tonight, we know where every one of</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.127" end="00:53:40.527" style="s2">them sits and who holds her comb.</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.927" end="00:53:45.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Girl, wake up. I need a name.</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.127" end="00:53:47.527" style="s2">A nanny out in Buckhead about a year</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.127" end="00:53:47.527" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.927" end="00:53:54.027" style="s2">Miss Pearl, number seven&#39;s my cousin&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.227" end="00:53:56.827" style="s2">cousin. She gets her edges done on</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.027" end="00:53:56.827" style="s2">Cascade Road.</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.827" end="00:54:01.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There you go. One down.</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.527" end="00:54:13.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, your maid was a thief. They found</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.327" end="00:54:15.627" style="s2">Simone&#39;s earrings in her bag in front of</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.727" end="00:54:17.827" style="s2">the whole staff.</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.627" end="00:54:20.327" style="s2">The police took her out of this house in</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.827" end="00:54:21.827" style="s2">handcuffs.</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.327" end="00:54:23.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve handled it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.827" end="00:54:24.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard you.</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.227" end="00:54:26.427" style="s2">How&#39;s Rosie?</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.527" end="00:54:27.832" style="s2">Put the phone by her ear. Let her hear</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.427" end="00:54:29.327" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.832" end="00:54:32.327" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.327" end="00:54:34.127" style="s2">Rosie, baby, it&#39;s Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.327" end="00:54:37.002" style="s2">I&#39;m coming home.</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.127" end="00:54:39.022" style="s2">You hold on for me, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.002" end="00:54:39.022" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.127" end="00:54:43.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See?</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.527" end="00:54:44.627" style="s2">Nothing. She&#39;s always quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.027" end="00:54:46.627" style="s2">Nothing has changed, little brother,</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.627" end="00:54:49.027" style="s2">except the house is a little cleaner.</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.627" end="00:54:51.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be at the gala tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.027" end="00:54:53.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Sign and let me carry this for</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.327" end="00:54:53.627" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.527" end="00:55:01.127" style="s2">Rosie flies Thursday morning.</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.618" end="00:55:03.527" style="s2">[music] Her beads, Miss Callaway, the</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.127" end="00:55:05.427" style="s2">ones from her hair.</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.527" end="00:55:07.828" style="s2">What should I do with them?</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.427" end="00:55:07.828" style="s2">Bin them.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.718" end="00:55:14.828" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:12.928" end="00:55:19.028" style="s2">And pack her trunk.</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.828" end="00:55:19.028" style="s2">Everything. Nothing of her mother&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.058" end="00:55:32.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.028" end="00:55:36.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t believe it for 1 second. Not</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.928" end="00:55:36.028" style="s2">when I heard your message.</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.228" end="00:55:39.628" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t leave until the last family</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.728" end="00:55:41.928" style="s2">had a doctor talking to them.</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.628" end="00:55:45.228" style="s2">Then I drove straight here.</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.928" end="00:55:47.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He drove. I just held on, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.228" end="00:55:51.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit down, both of you. The coffee&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.428" end="00:55:51.328" style="s2">strong and the chairs don&#39;t match.</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.528" end="00:55:58.828" style="s2">She sent me to the kitchen so she could</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.928" end="00:56:02.028" style="s2">have a minute with my bag.</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.828" end="00:56:02.028" style="s2">Rosie was in the doorway.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.703" end="00:56:10.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.323" end="00:56:13.343" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.728" end="00:56:17.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 12 checks,</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.028" end="00:56:19.528" style="s2">all marked severance, all out of my</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.828" end="00:56:22.428" style="s2">daughter&#39;s trust,</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.528" end="00:56:24.728" style="s2">and $14 million more in four transfers</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.428" end="00:56:26.028" style="s2">to CL Holdings,</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.728" end="00:56:28.328" style="s2">her company.</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.028" end="00:56:30.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Out of Rosie&#39;s money.</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.328" end="00:56:32.228" style="s2">CL Holdings,</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.028" end="00:56:34.628" style="s2">same company that bought my building and</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.228" end="00:56:35.928" style="s2">put a chain on my door.</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.628" end="00:56:37.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight [music] she stands up in front</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.928" end="00:56:41.128" style="s2">of the whole city,</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.528" end="00:56:42.728" style="s2">and I make her sole trustee.</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.128" end="00:56:43.928" style="s2">Then nobody ever opens these books</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.728" end="00:56:46.228" style="s2">again. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.928" end="00:56:48.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let her walk up to that table,</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.228" end="00:56:51.728" style="s2">Mr. Calloway.</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.928" end="00:56:55.628" style="s2">Let her get all the way to the pen,</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.728" end="00:56:55.628" style="s2">and I&#39;ll be the one who stops her.</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.228" end="00:57:01.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.428" end="00:57:01.328" style="s2">My name is Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.034" end="00:57:08.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.428" end="00:57:09.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was number three.</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.628" end="00:57:11.729" style="s2">Two days</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.928" end="00:57:14.129" style="s2">I cried in that driver&#39;s back seat all</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.729" end="00:57:15.829" style="s2">the way to the airport.</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.129" end="00:57:19.429" style="s2">I thought it was me.</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.829" end="00:57:19.429" style="s2">I thought I&#39;d failed that baby.</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.129" end="00:57:24.129" style="s2">I was number one.</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.329" end="00:57:27.829" style="s2">She told me that baby screamed every</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.329" end="00:57:29.729" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.829" end="00:57:33.129" style="s2">I was there five weeks</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.729" end="00:57:35.629" style="s2">and I never heard one sound out of her.</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.129" end="00:57:37.329" style="s2">Not one.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.629" end="00:57:38.729" style="s2">I was number seven. I signed it at her</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.329" end="00:57:40.329" style="s2">kitchen table.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.729" end="00:57:42.629" style="s2">She had the pen out before I even sat</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.329" end="00:57:42.629" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.529" end="00:57:48.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold still, Nia. You&#39;re shaking my whole</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.529" end="00:57:48.429" style="s2">crown loose.</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.729" end="00:57:58.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said I wouldn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.229" end="00:57:58.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you did.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.729" end="00:58:02.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That first morning, the whole staff</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.429" end="00:58:04.929" style="s2">stood there and watched me drag that</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.929" end="00:58:07.529" style="s2">suitcase down the stairs and not one of</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.929" end="00:58:07.529" style="s2">them moved.</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.829" end="00:58:12.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You carried it down the steps for me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.155" end="00:58:17.929" style="s2">[music] So I&#39;m number 12 and I&#39;ll say it</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.329" end="00:58:17.929" style="s2">out loud.</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.529" end="00:58:29.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 12 strands, baby, and she doesn&#39;t stand</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.029" end="00:58:29.829" style="s2">a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.495" end="00:58:33.515" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.045" end="00:58:40.065" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.940" end="00:58:47.529" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.829" end="00:58:49.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you all for coming out on a cold</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.529" end="00:58:51.529" style="s2">Wednesday night for my sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.429" end="00:58:54.529" style="s2">Simone loved this city and this city</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.529" end="00:58:54.529" style="s2">loved her right back.</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.029" end="00:59:03.429" style="s2">My brother has been so brave this year.</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.929" end="00:59:07.029" style="s2">Most of you know about our little girl.</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.429" end="00:59:10.029" style="s2">My niece is broken</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.029" end="00:59:12.729" style="s2">and broken things need professionals,</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.029" end="00:59:14.231" style="s2">not wishes.</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.729" end="00:59:16.531" style="s2">Tomorrow morning, Rosie flies to</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.231" end="00:59:18.931" style="s2">Switzerland to the finest children&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.531" end="00:59:21.331" style="s2">program in Europe, and she begins to</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.931" end="00:59:21.331" style="s2">heal.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.131" end="00:59:28.131" style="s2">And tonight, Ethan asked me to carry her</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.031" end="00:59:28.131" style="s2">future for him as her trusty.</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.931" end="00:59:31.531" style="s2">Little brother?</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.066" end="00:59:35.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.831" end="00:59:36.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before I sign, tell them what the doctor</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.531" end="00:59:38.031" style="s2">wrote.</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.431" end="00:59:41.231" style="s2">The way you told it to me. [music] I</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.031" end="00:59:41.231" style="s2">want the whole room to hear it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.331" end="00:59:47.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every one of them left that house</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.131" end="00:59:50.331" style="s2">afraid,</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.331" end="00:59:52.431" style="s2">and every one of them put it in writing.</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.331" end="00:59:54.681" style="s2">Dr. Hollis put all 12 letters in his</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.431" end="00:59:56.631" style="s2">report.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.681" end="00:59:58.831" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.631" end="01:00:01.131" style="s2">A little girl who frightens grown women</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.831" end="01:00:04.031" style="s2">doesn&#39;t belong alone in a big house with</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.131" end="01:00:04.031" style="s2">a grieving father.</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.231" end="01:00:13.831" style="s2">Sign, little brother. Let me carry it</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.431" end="01:00:13.831" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.981" end="01:00:36.001" style="s2">[bell and music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.031" end="01:00:44.931" style="s2">Somebody call security. That&#39;s the hair</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.331" end="01:00:44.931" style="s2">girl who stole Simone&#39;s earrings.</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.531" end="01:00:53.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her speak, CC.</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.431" end="01:00:54.942" style="s2">She came a long way to get into this</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.031" end="01:00:56.962" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.942" end="01:00:56.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.131" end="01:01:01.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The first morning I walked into your</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.631" end="01:01:04.431" style="s2">house, you told me a maid doesn&#39;t look</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.531" end="01:01:07.231" style="s2">at your niece and doesn&#39;t talk to her.</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.431" end="01:01:07.231" style="s2">I&#39;m talking now.</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.627" end="01:01:16.332" style="s2">[music] I am a hair girl.</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.431" end="01:01:18.732" style="s2">I braided Simone Calloway&#39;s hair for</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.332" end="01:01:22.032" style="s2">eight years in chair three at Pearl&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.732" end="01:01:22.032" style="s2">Braids on Campbellton Road.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.132" end="01:01:26.632" style="s2">And her daughter&#39;s hair since she was</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.732" end="01:01:26.632" style="s2">two years old.</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.532" end="01:01:32.732" style="s2">Nanny one,</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.832" end="01:01:35.552" style="s2">I can no longer stay in a home where I</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.732" end="01:01:37.572" style="s2">fear for my safety.</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.552" end="01:01:37.572" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.932" end="01:01:41.932" style="s2">Nanny two,</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.732" end="01:01:45.132" style="s2">I can no longer stay in a home where I</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.932" end="01:01:45.132" style="s2">fear [music] for my safety.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.832" end="01:01:52.582" style="s2">Nanny three,</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.132" end="01:01:53.732" style="s2">nanny four, nanny five.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.582" end="01:01:57.932" style="s2">[bell]</p>
<p begin="01:01:53.732" end="01:01:57.932" style="s2">The same words, every one of them.</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.132" end="01:02:04.632" style="s2">Six, seven, eight, nine, 10, 11, and</p>
<p begin="01:02:02.532" end="01:02:08.132" style="s2">number 12 who carried her suitcase down</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.632" end="01:02:08.132" style="s2">your stairs the morning I came.</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.932" end="01:02:17.132" style="s2">12 women who came and went from that</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.732" end="01:02:18.932" style="s2">house in one year, and every one of them</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.132" end="01:02:21.332" style="s2">wrote the very same sentence word for</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.932" end="01:02:21.332" style="s2">word.</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.057" end="01:02:25.232" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.732" end="01:02:27.332" style="s2">Same comma. Dr. Hollis counted them as</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.232" end="01:02:31.732" style="s2">12 observations.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.332" end="01:02:31.732" style="s2">It&#39;s one sentence and 12 signatures.</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.732" end="01:02:39.798" style="s2">Ms. Calloway wrote it.</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.778" end="01:02:39.798" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.363" end="01:02:44.383" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.632" end="01:02:49.432" style="s2">My name is on that letter,</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.532" end="01:02:52.232" style="s2">and it&#39;s a lie.</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.432" end="01:02:55.732" style="s2">Ms. Calloway paid me $12,000 to walk out</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.232" end="01:02:55.732" style="s2">of that house and sign her sentence.</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.773" end="01:03:01.232" style="s2">[bell]</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.732" end="01:03:04.432" style="s2">That little girl never heard anybody.</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.232" end="01:03:04.432" style="s2">She sat at the window.</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.253" end="01:03:10.932" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.732" end="01:03:13.332" style="s2">She&#39;s a bitter employee with a grudge.</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.932" end="01:03:14.932" style="s2">They all are. I paid generous severance,</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.332" end="01:03:18.132" style="s2">which is more than most families in this</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.932" end="01:03:19.633" style="s2">room would do. You You pay it,</p>
<p begin="01:03:18.132" end="01:03:22.233" style="s2">but those checks didn&#39;t come out of your</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.633" end="01:03:25.333" style="s2">account, Ms. Callaway.</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.233" end="01:03:29.433" style="s2">They came out of Rosie&#39;s own trust.</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.333" end="01:03:29.433" style="s2">A 6-year-old paid 12 women to leave her.</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.038" end="01:03:40.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.933" end="01:03:42.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my daughter&#39;s trust.</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.733" end="01:03:45.033" style="s2">And those last lines are my sister&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.633" end="01:03:45.033" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.233" end="01:03:58.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 12 checks and every one of them took it.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.433" end="01:04:07.933" style="s2">Nobody could stand that silent child,</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.133" end="01:04:09.733" style="s2">and somebody had to pay them to stay</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.933" end="01:04:11.733" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.733" end="01:04:15.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every one of them took it. Not one of</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.733" end="01:04:15.133" style="s2">them was hurt by that child.</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.233" end="01:04:20.333" style="s2">You paid a grieving baby&#39;s money to make</p>
<p begin="01:04:18.133" end="01:04:25.033" style="s2">her look broken.</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.333" end="01:04:25.033" style="s2">14 million out of a little girl&#39;s trust?</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.333" end="01:04:32.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should have said this the day this</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.933" end="01:04:35.233" style="s2">young woman came to my office.</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.733" end="01:04:37.333" style="s2">I saw the child once</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.233" end="01:04:39.609" style="s2">for 10 minutes.</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.333" end="01:04:41.629" style="s2">She hid behind the maid the whole time.</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.609" end="01:04:41.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.933" end="01:04:44.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Martin,</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.933" end="01:04:47.533" style="s2">sit down.</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.233" end="01:04:47.533" style="s2">You&#39;re embarrassing yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.434" end="01:04:51.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.533" end="01:04:53.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Callaway supplied the letters and</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.433" end="01:04:56.833" style="s2">asked me for the conclusion. I wrote it,</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.933" end="01:04:56.833" style="s2">and I put my name on it.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.433" end="01:05:06.233" style="s2">For the record, I had an arrangement</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.533" end="01:05:08.233" style="s2">with Ms. Callaway about her niece&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.233" end="01:05:10.633" style="s2">shares in the company.</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.233" end="01:05:13.533" style="s2">That arrangement is over tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.633" end="01:05:16.633" style="s2">My bank will call her loan on the 31st,</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.533" end="01:05:20.533" style="s2">all 60 million of it.</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.633" end="01:05:20.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor, we can talk about this upstairs.</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.133" end="01:05:25.233" style="s2">Victor,</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.835" end="01:05:32.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not chair of Simone&#39;s foundation,</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.700" end="01:05:36.035" style="s2">[music] not after tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.835" end="01:05:36.035" style="s2">And you&#39;re not living in my house.</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.835" end="01:05:40.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan,</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.035" end="01:05:41.935" style="s2">I did this for the family. Somebody had</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.335" end="01:05:44.635" style="s2">to keep this family standing while you</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.935" end="01:05:47.735" style="s2">hid in your office.</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.635" end="01:05:47.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did this to my daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.735" end="01:05:57.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the earrings? Simone&#39;s diamonds fell</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.835" end="01:05:59.735" style="s2">out of your bag in front of my whole</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.235" end="01:05:59.735" style="s2">staff.</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.735" end="01:06:07.335" style="s2">12 maids don&#39;t change the fact that</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.535" end="01:06:07.335" style="s2">you&#39;re a thief.</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.635" end="01:06:15.835" style="s2">You told this whole city Rosie can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.435" end="01:06:17.835" style="s2">talk. You never once asked if she could</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.835" end="01:06:19.835" style="s2">write.</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.835" end="01:06:23.635" style="s2">She put this in my coat pocket the same</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.835" end="01:06:23.635" style="s2">night you put the earrings in my bag.</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.435" end="01:06:34.435" style="s2">C E C E D I D Cece did.</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.935" end="01:06:41.435" style="s2">A 6-year-old&#39;s beads? You want this city</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.435" end="01:06:44.535" style="s2">to take the word of a broken little girl</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.435" end="01:06:44.535" style="s2">and a piece of string?</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.026" end="01:06:50.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell and music]</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.035" end="01:06:54.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They stopped us at a church door once.</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.535" end="01:06:54.535" style="s2">Nobody&#39;s stopping this baby at this one.</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.541" end="01:06:56.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.735" end="01:07:09.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Cece put them in Nia&#39;s bag. I saw.</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.335" end="01:07:13.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Somebody coached her. That woman and her</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.335" end="01:07:16.935" style="s2">grandmother have been putting words in</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.835" end="01:07:16.935" style="s2">her mouth for weeks.</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.735" end="01:07:24.036" style="s2">Honey, nobody in in city could put one</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.935" end="01:07:27.436" style="s2">word in that child&#39;s mouth. Not her</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.036" end="01:07:30.236" style="s2">daddy, not 12 nannies, not you.</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.436" end="01:07:33.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 13 months.</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.236" end="01:07:33.336" style="s2">I&#39;m not broken.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.701" end="01:07:43.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.536" end="01:07:45.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi baby.</p>
<p begin="01:07:43.736" end="01:07:48.251" style="s2">You say anything you want to say. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:07:45.736" end="01:07:50.271" style="s2">right here and I&#39;m not going anywhere.</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.251" end="01:07:50.271" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.136" end="01:07:57.936" style="s2">13 months and she picks a room with 300</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.336" end="01:07:57.936" style="s2">people in it.</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.636" end="01:08:11.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Callaway called me this afternoon</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.336" end="01:08:12.936" style="s2">and asked me to come here tonight and</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.836" end="01:08:14.536" style="s2">listen.</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.936" end="01:08:16.936" style="s2">I&#39;m glad I did.</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.536" end="01:08:19.336" style="s2">Miss Callaway, you&#39;re under arrest for</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.936" end="01:08:21.136" style="s2">filing a false police report</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.336" end="01:08:23.736" style="s2">and for theft from the Rosie Callaway</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.136" end="01:08:25.536" style="s2">Trust.</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.736" end="01:08:27.836" style="s2">You can&#39;t do this here. Do you have any</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.536" end="01:08:30.136" style="s2">idea whose gala this is?</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.836" end="01:08:33.236" style="s2">Yes ma&#39;am. It&#39;s your sister-in-law&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.136" end="01:08:33.236" style="s2">Hands in front of you please.</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.936" end="01:08:48.236" style="s2">Miss Lawson, the charge against you is</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.136" end="01:08:49.936" style="s2">withdrawn as of tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.236" end="01:08:52.536" style="s2">My officers walked you out in handcuffs</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.936" end="01:08:54.036" style="s2">in the rain. I&#39;m sorry for that.</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.536" end="01:08:55.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.036" end="01:08:57.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just give Simone&#39;s earrings back to her</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.936" end="01:08:59.636" style="s2">husband.</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.336" end="01:09:00.736" style="s2">That&#39;s all I want from tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.636" end="01:09:02.636" style="s2">Ethan,</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.736" end="01:09:05.436" style="s2">Ethan, I&#39;m your sister.</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.636" end="01:09:08.936" style="s2">I sat up with you the night she died.</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.436" end="01:09:10.536" style="s2">I held your hand at that funeral.</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.936" end="01:09:12.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sat with me so you could reach her</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.536" end="01:09:12.836" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.036" end="01:09:21.736" style="s2">You were Rosie&#39;s aunt. You stopped being</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.336" end="01:09:24.336" style="s2">anything to her the day you made her</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.736" end="01:09:24.336" style="s2">look broken.</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.236" end="01:09:31.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where am I supposed to go tonight? That</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.938" end="01:09:32.637" style="s2">house is my home. Ethan, please. Look at</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.538" end="01:09:34.637" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.637" end="01:09:37.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pack your trunk, Cece. Everything.</p>
<p begin="01:09:34.637" end="01:09:37.538" style="s2">Nothing of hers.</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.738" end="01:10:04.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Calloway, did you take the money</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.637" end="01:10:06.938" style="s2">from your niece&#39;s trust? Did you frame</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.438" end="01:10:06.938" style="s2">the maid?</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.637" end="01:10:13.637" style="s2">12 of us took your money to leave, Miss</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.637" end="01:10:15.137" style="s2">Calloway. Everybody takes the money to</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.637" end="01:10:17.538" style="s2">leave, right?</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.137" end="01:10:20.637" style="s2">Your turn to leave.</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.538" end="01:10:20.637" style="s2">Somebody book her seat.</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.238" end="01:10:33.038" style="s2">Senior is [music] serious. To me is</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.137" end="01:10:33.038" style="s2">another pies.</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.637" end="01:10:39.238" style="s2">Get your hand off my arm.</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.553" end="01:10:41.438" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.238" end="01:10:45.038" style="s2">I&#39;m a Calloway. My lawyers will have me</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.438" end="01:10:45.038" style="s2">home before you finished your paperwork.</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.538" end="01:10:50.838" style="s2">Your lawyers are going to need a lawyer,</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.838" end="01:10:54.738" style="s2">Miss Calloway. There are 12 of us</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.838" end="01:10:54.738" style="s2">standing right here with our letters.</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.137" end="01:11:01.938" style="s2">Miss Lawson. Miss Lawson, what do you</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.338" end="01:11:03.738" style="s2">want to say to her?</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.938" end="01:11:07.238" style="s2">Don&#39;t look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.738" end="01:11:07.238" style="s2">Don&#39;t you dare look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.738" end="01:11:10.738" style="s2">You told me I don&#39;t look and I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.538" end="01:11:14.238" style="s2">talk.</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.738" end="01:11:17.438" style="s2">I&#39;m looking at you, Miss Calloway.</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.238" end="01:11:17.438" style="s2">And I&#39;m done talking to you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.124" end="01:11:42.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.439" end="01:11:57.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Pearl, there&#39;s a line out the door</p>
<p begin="01:11:55.839" end="01:11:59.939" style="s2">and all the way down past the taco</p>
<p begin="01:11:57.539" end="01:11:59.939" style="s2">window.</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.539" end="01:12:06.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell the taco man to sell them</p>
<p begin="01:12:04.139" end="01:12:06.739" style="s2">lunch.</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.839" end="01:12:10.439" style="s2">We&#39;re not turning one baby away from</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.839" end="01:12:12.739" style="s2">this shop.</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.439" end="01:12:14.639" style="s2">That building was bought with Rosie&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.739" end="01:12:18.439" style="s2">stolen money.</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.639" end="01:12:20.739" style="s2">So the court handed it to Rosie&#39;s trust.</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.439" end="01:12:24.010" style="s2">That baby&#39;s my landlord now, and I pay</p>
<p begin="01:12:20.739" end="01:12:26.030" style="s2">her like anybody else.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.010" end="01:12:26.030" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.739" end="01:12:35.145" style="s2">$18,000 back rent and a brand new lease</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.039" end="01:12:37.639" style="s2">and not one penny of it charity.</p>
<p begin="01:12:35.145" end="01:12:39.739" style="s2">[music] Tell them baby.</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.639" end="01:12:43.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every hour I worked in that house at a</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.739" end="01:12:43.839" style="s2">nanny&#39;s rate back to day one.</p>
<p begin="01:12:44.139" end="01:12:49.139" style="s2">Ethan said nanny work gets nanny pay.</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.039" end="01:12:50.865" style="s2">And that one I took because I earned</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.139" end="01:12:51.339" style="s2">every hour of it.</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.865" end="01:12:53.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:12:51.339" end="01:12:55.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the foundation pays for the Saturday</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.939" end="01:12:58.139" style="s2">chair.</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.939" end="01:13:00.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I asked them to.</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.139" end="01:13:02.839" style="s2">The last time somebody offered me money,</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.239" end="01:13:05.139" style="s2">I said no.</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.839" end="01:13:06.339" style="s2">This time I&#39;m the one asking.</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.139" end="01:13:09.439" style="s2">Apprentice</p>
<p begin="01:13:06.339" end="01:13:12.839" style="s2">day 40. Miss Pearl says by day 50 she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.439" end="01:13:12.839" style="s2">let me do a part on my own.</p>
<p begin="01:13:13.439" end="01:13:18.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said day 60.</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.939" end="01:13:19.939" style="s2">Keep your hands soft.</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.439" end="01:13:22.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got the gold beads. I&#39;ve got the</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.939" end="01:13:25.839" style="s2">clear ones, and I&#39;ve been told very</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.139" end="01:13:25.839" style="s2">clearly not to touch anything else.</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.039" end="01:13:34.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And then the squirrel</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.540" end="01:13:34.840" style="s2">Sir, that&#39;s my donut.</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.740" end="01:13:41.301" style="s2">And the policeman said,</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.040" end="01:13:43.640" style="s2">Then why is it on your head?</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.301" end="01:13:45.240" style="s2">[laughter] And Nia, then the squirrel</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.640" end="01:13:47.040" style="s2">said,</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.240" end="01:13:50.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold still, Miss Chatterbox. You can</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.040" end="01:13:50.340" style="s2">tell me the rest on the next row.</p>
<p begin="01:13:50.470" end="01:13:53.746" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.340" end="01:13:55.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She talks more than you now, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.746" end="01:13:55.766" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.140" end="01:14:05.740" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to see you in that gray</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.240" end="01:14:07.940" style="s2">uniform again. Not in this house. Not</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.740" end="01:14:07.940" style="s2">ever.</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.040" end="01:14:14.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t going to wear it, Ethan. I gave</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.140" end="01:14:17.440" style="s2">it back to the house manager on Monday.</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.240" end="01:14:19.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ironed. I raised her right.</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.440" end="01:14:21.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then have dinner with me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.340" end="01:14:23.540" style="s2">Not as your boss and not with half of</p>
<p begin="01:14:21.640" end="01:14:26.340" style="s2">Atlanta watching.</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.540" end="01:14:27.940" style="s2">Just you and me on Friday.</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.340" end="01:14:29.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On Saturdays you sit in the waiting</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.940" end="01:14:30.840" style="s2">chair.</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.240" end="01:14:33.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every Saturday.</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.840" end="01:14:33.840" style="s2">For as long, keep the chair.</p>
<p begin="01:14:36.140" end="01:14:39.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you have to hold the beads, Daddy,</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.840" end="01:14:40.940" style="s2">and you can&#39;t braid. Your braids are</p>
<p begin="01:14:39.840" end="01:14:42.640" style="s2">still crooked.</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.940" end="01:14:45.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re getting better.</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.640" end="01:14:47.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They are not, baby.</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.340" end="01:14:47.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then Friday.</p>
<p begin="01:14:49.421" end="01:14:51.441" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.340" end="01:14:56.640" style="s2">For 20 years I thought a chair was the</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.240" end="01:14:58.840" style="s2">place where place where people leave</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.640" end="01:14:58.840" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:00.140" end="01:15:06.340" style="s2">My mama left me in a chair when I was</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.740" end="01:15:06.340" style="s2">six. Simone left her baby in my chair.</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.540" end="01:15:12.240" style="s2">And now I&#39;m sitting at a table with all</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.840" end="01:15:12.240" style="s2">of you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.340" end="01:15:17.240" style="s2">I&#39;m home.</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.040" end="01:15:18.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were always home, baby.</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.240" end="01:15:21.440" style="s2">It just took the rest of us a while to</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.740" end="01:15:21.440" style="s2">set the table.</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.140" end="01:15:35.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dex, what is this?</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.542" end="01:15:37.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The nanny pool.</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.942" end="01:15:39.442" style="s2">Every dollar this staff ever bet against</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.942" end="01:15:41.542" style="s2">you,</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.442" end="01:15:44.542" style="s2">from the cook on down.</p>
<p begin="01:15:41.542" end="01:15:47.742" style="s2">Nobody bet forever but me.</p>
<p begin="01:15:44.542" end="01:15:47.742" style="s2">Worst bet I ever won.</p>
<p begin="01:15:50.337" end="01:15:52.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.042" end="01:16:00.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; New day made starts today.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.942" end="01:16:03.342" style="s2">Floors, glass, and the East Wing.</p>
<p begin="01:16:00.942" end="01:16:05.842" style="s2">And somebody will show you the rest.</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.342" end="01:16:05.842" style="s2">Kindly</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.842" end="01:16:24.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two buses this morning?</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.942" end="01:16:26.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two there and two home, ma&#39;am. Home,</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.942" end="01:16:29.242" style="s2">ma&#39;am. I didn&#39;t want to be late on the</p>
<p begin="01:16:26.542" end="01:16:29.242" style="s2">first day.</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.942" end="01:16:35.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know those buses. You&#39;ll get a lot of</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.142" end="01:16:35.242" style="s2">thinking done on them.</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.642" end="01:16:41.042" style="s2">First day?</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.342" end="01:16:43.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.042" end="01:16:45.042" style="s2">They told me at the agency this house is</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.242" end="01:16:48.342" style="s2">hard.</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.042" end="01:16:51.042" style="s2">They said 12 nannies quit in one year.</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.342" end="01:16:53.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was a hard house once.</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.042" end="01:16:54.242" style="s2">It isn&#39;t anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.218" end="01:16:55.742" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:16:54.242" end="01:16:57.803" style="s2">Nobody here is going to tell you where</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.742" end="01:16:59.823" style="s2">to put your eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.803" end="01:16:59.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.423" end="01:17:02.443" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.742" end="01:17:11.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Breakfast in the staff kitchen, baby.</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.042" end="01:17:11.642" style="s2">Grits are hot and nobody</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.442" end="01:17:20.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome to the house.</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.042" end="01:17:22.342" style="s2">If anybody here gives you a hard time,</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.442" end="01:17:23.842" style="s2">you come and find her.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.342" end="01:17:25.742" style="s2">She&#39;ll sort it out before I&#39;ve even</p>
<p begin="01:17:23.842" end="01:17:27.442" style="s2">heard about it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:25.742" end="01:17:28.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She hands those out to the people she</p>
<p begin="01:17:27.442" end="01:17:32.242" style="s2">likes.</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.942" end="01:17:32.242" style="s2">You&#39;re the first one this month.</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.742" end="01:17:39.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, sweetheart. What&#39;s it for?</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.343" end="01:17:42.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One strand breaks,</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.543" end="01:17:42.743" style="s2">three strands hold.</p>
<p begin="01:17:44.308" end="01:17:46.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.134" end="01:17:56.154" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.959" end="01:18:05.979" style="s2">[music]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
